    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHvKuBqb3Bo0R4M6wFeiGIu4LvmMv8c97tAqRlpCmDbIgwa-TT2LQVq7VoT2qEokYrECCixREc6LeDbK8_gbYdlUzZZw9qIJBLQKvrOxJwWsMVqv0QjQHRLtMpOTT4="
      title: "github.io"
    }
    summary: "The Invidious API provides a way to interact with Invidious instances, offering data in JSON format and the ability to access audio streams.\n\n**Invidious Instances:**\nA list of public Invidious instances is available, along with rules and criteria for their operation, such as requiring statistics (`/api/v1/stats`) to be enabled and maintaining a high uptime[1]. These instances act as alternative frontends to YouTube, extracting data without using the official YouTube API[2][3].\n\n**JSON Output:**\nAll Invidious API endpoints that return a body of data do so in JSON format. These JSON responses can be translated into a desired language using the `&hl=LANGUAGE` parameter[4]. The API defines common object types like `VideoObject`, `ChannelObject`, and `PlaylistObject`, all of which are returned as JSON[5].\n\n**Audio Streams:**\nThe Invidious API allows access to URLs for audio sources[6]. Specifically, when querying video data, the `adaptiveFormats` field within the JSON response will contain information about available audio streams. These can be filtered by their `type`, where audio sources will have a type starting with \"audio\"[6]. Invidious is designed to provide features like background audio on mobile[7]. It\'s noted that audio streams are often provided as DASH streams[8]. Applications like InvidTUI and SailTube leverage the Invidious API to play audio or video from these instances[9][10].\n\nSources:\n[1] [invidious.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3KU1dYYkWojnTCR5fFpfaz8diTnyy4zx0K8PlIB1X2EpvJWPH52ugJ5STSot04KDvXr-frsaywnU1AUz66fTTwfysmAL_GjIEWCsUiZWNAbDp3SoiOpWodJ5Vl0lXCg==)\n[2] [freetubeapp.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGxCnHdsO644vtCG5KcaXA8v2WwzwMzMPeBBwbreil60PsouMn8kkn9jrR_0p3omal58lC4UROw-uKhBybUmuKtpSQYZRfMS4ygscoeKNxcBii5-3vvBFtXaMUGc-shcfX_eg4lrtuwnjKR6A==)\n[3] [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHYRUpLdG2JofNAjy-mzpXgiKwWNQaEb42cgxxKaskTlPJHkZNzTt1ltHO35wKahRgsL6iUxZQ2Lily0paNlSdWQ26TV9I4NwCyUjzX2TW6p1hl4UccR4paZMYMDs5KB518Ww==)\n[4] [invidious.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGjg8rfZBtL4KVtjkJF6lDWQTMersuPiIdhbPsZTkxiSLmYzhIOo1lvLIzPv_jsPGjztb_l-GhwB91w-SSZ1iKDNTkJckfCexSY5fltITTHkIXod1475UMA3Q==)\n[5] [invidious.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEHWl-P5bkw1oZAt3dzF-GD5vq7nx4X5kYlch_W6RyFim3rzIrwxThIxkb3BLz6C53cHgpbT3kloSlvLFOZYmmZB6KUrYz677AqDKJKTklInsW0pGiXEcTS-eCCmlWaWI8r3XoA4lc=)\n[6] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEFJY-Pmx5S3CTnP6Y_khB5jGbmHLehJq59L80b-23w1MMtFdY7Gesn96SvlLlTZTw1qbDsF565OgxTljJGSSQHtiZhGLFBSaHriaxCQnkaL_3GXYJp8AVrCwROrfaAHZ3rkU4lXrFhgsvV)\n[7] [themenonlab.blog](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQETayZqbI0fxyD8nOe7RIqKPkKLjIXKupOnphrHqR2yoN7lWuX2oWN442-Bhx9NOh354Zi7n_vleqI9MhlCLddMwRoaWzRTwZWoCD5BmB9LIuvSi8K26iWKG0NtVWrw3MFHeTK59WHFXHyFjqb29HpuioSxRIAxNfUHScRSvkDJyfZ38nnA7ButvKhV0z4p)\n[8] [antennapod.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGHWkese9eCXFahiphwvMb_nSu0WwplGZmioLIYqgw3gzrwmeIg-c3kDkUWDdJhlLqk1JY_7WhTX2WhRCzUPLcbX9YXtJEiVcOi6LhvmW8tOL6ZFSJyk-sQxEtl0GYlvr_rhBIQ1SE3tg7M6zR3coW8lRF2cwWYR-yHzYHfkBT3WzA=)\n[9] [sailfishos.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEQbmNwJEtjVJqr6AfGp_JCeBG9mrVsnSGPkPN5bogYl5OJHgYjwIDUzNy8WTvC_ab9IrWpKIjO3-pC_DUuRiORK9yHlk-79JCEvEyTnjBrQ3mYHi4vlgywwgwMYAAO7FFA-rQzeiG7UZncGnIH6dJzQNRMxJ6dDA0LenXF4sLJ)\n[10] [github.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHvKuBqb3Bo0R4M6wFeiGIu4LvmMv8c97tAqRlpCmDbIgwa-TT2LQVq7VoT2qEokYrECCixREc6LeDbK8_gbYdlUzZZw9qIJBLQKvrOxJwWsMVqv0QjQHRLtMpOTT4=)"
