  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Addressing the Loading Issue**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the `DeckCard` component and the absence of a loading indicator. I realized the user gets no visual feedback while a track is loading, especially from external sources like YouTube. I\'m now planning to introduce improvements within `DeckUiState`, and I have some ideas for implementing visual cues.\n\n\n**Investigating Media Controls**\n\nI\'m now investigating Android media notifications to address the missing controls issue. Specifically, I\'m examining how `androidx.media.app.NotificationCompat.MediaStyle` integrates with the media player to ensure the controls are present in both the lock screen and the Android drawer. The goal is to ensure a seamless user experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Media Controls**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating `MediaSessionCompat` to control media notifications on Android. I\'ve mapped out the required actions: previous, play/pause, and next track. I intend to use `MediaStyle` to display the controls concisely. Then, setting the media session\'s playback state and actions should trigger Android\'s System UI to display the media player card with all the required UI components.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 433383277
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
