    thinking: "**Analyzing App Interaction**\n\nI\'ve made a breakthrough! I realized `AuraDeckApp.instance` is accessible within `AuraPlaybackService`. This opens the door for direct control. I can now call methods like `togglePlayPause()` and `skipToNextTrack()` directly from the service. The next step is to examine how these methods respond to user clicks.\n\n\n**Implementing Notification Controls**\n\nI\'ve integrated `audioEngine.togglePlayPause(activeDeckId)` for notification play/pause functionality. Next, clicking \'Next\' triggers track loading from the repository or playlist. Regarding sharing, the `MainActivity.kt` code reveals the handling of shared text via `Intent.ACTION_SEND`. I\'m investigating how the app currently handles text containing extra information like YouTube video URLs, specifically how `StreamResolver.extractYoutubeVideoId` uses regex to extract the video ID.\n\n\n**Refining YouTube URL Handling**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the YouTube URL parsing and playback logic. I\'ve pinpointed an issue where `resolveYoutubeTrack` wasn\'t always properly handling shared URLs with extra text. This meant the URL wasn\'t clean, and the `MediaPlayer` failed. Now, I\'m focusing on ensuring robust URL extraction, immediate library insertion, and successful audio stream resolution for reliable playback.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 58880529
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
