      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGtAqBJgsZxnU9291AGR-yNYl0bfP5CKrEICCZdsmQWElvXYIZpkqX8wx0RrTYNrJnsgJdI1WH7kIE9stPH_S_o2s1gNcxFZVkke_VRfSPQGf-wmDAWaSRUR3rS0Kyh2C6rZrkw1tReJtEz"
      title: "bluelightai.com"
    }
    summary: "There are several different APIs referred to as \"Cobalt API,\" and the term \"free instances\" can have different meanings depending on which API is in question.\n\nIf you are referring to the open-source Cobalt API primarily used for media downloading, individuals or communities may host their own instances. These instances are typically free to use by the public, though they may implement bot protection or require authentication[1][2]. A GitHub Gist provides a method for finding such instances by using specific search queries (e.g., checking for a particular `body_hash` or ports 9000/9001) and often lists endpoints like `/api/json` for retrieving information in JSON format[3]. For example, URLs such as `https://coapi.kelig.me/api/json` are noted as providing JSON output for these types of instances[3]. Hosted instances of this API are stateless and do not store user data[2].\n\nFor the Cobalt API related to penetration testing (PtaaS - Pentest-as-a-Service), customers can integrate their assets, pentests, and findings into their workflows. This API offers a \"free entry tier\" for evaluation and low-volume integrations[4][5]. However, this \"free tier\" refers to access for Cobalt customers to their own data, rather than a list of publicly available, unauthenticated instances. To use this API, you typically need a personal API access token and often an organization token for most API calls[6][7]. Responses from this API are generally in JSON format[6].\n\nOther Cobalt APIs include:\n*   **Cobalt Intelligence API:** This API is used for searching business and court case data[8].\n*   **BluelightAI Cobalt API:** This API is associated with data analysis and workspace management[9].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGA9dPs3Hbuu1cksQuJA-zsVQWjgbnEsNwldoKJUVmkJmJ5Q4YXXYVzTSR7auXsZjb9gTwTY585mH1pjgdIUuW0FhopY_Rxyjg9yhUbg-gB-n9lHHQCrS2cjd-8zQs4AalaWJTVokQj1-ccIvKKGQggRKaw)\n[2] [railway.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGJRbNzonvorX23biJQW6CwJb1UbOT9XehT03McFYIPIhsJsASO8rnBX2718SN20t5X1ehvRDdwkb9O8T0MIkpVV96voJ3rEyuihpvnaZbsUFxybEzVyUuZ3TACJYAvVwQyepEl2GXx_KHqI30hmr3t)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGYZKQoOlnZ16iqqE6O0WQQwN3Eb_BjiEi9jyi3WxZ1a10AMTNsjJ5yzIxTFpzKP8F0w-9pbu8umn6eUfVXoqrsI2fT6GMEgkqoImNz4Q5TzT59dck9JKjbHy0pswMe3ZrJxKDW1GQBIf7rg67CZGkijW7VVq1m8WKxqu2VswTITA==)\n[4] [apis.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEWzdq7LASHp-T9pZKk0G_SqZ4AWy1tfRmqpckr36uNbHDk4tsu0VJJmEftoDBZ0MuUrHC8Uv0rSSSNM4HAojiC9nvcnDl7n4Hlu97_gpSdxjXgFKMRKrivJzjKseDY-1wgqt2aw8a2Jv2rKMwD)\n[5] [cobalt.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHjoJKWlmVVRyjAXzhIP3e5jcotaSAUGkyFZndozUbHef7zl4-_zK-O0m5le035XEHizsLH1JKmq8uEepe-jYLTwxtzEoInqwJPnKsjP_A4iKVt96a6eAcWJtOhGs7CWa3zlqRhR-nR5Xx5)\n[6] [cobalt.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGXoKjI3APOujCu4yEZhXQdAfZjwv19sD9P3If3XjlD-_bolExxNON__F3X66P2BGv7eMTpTPbZzqU07fqLWZrgYkj-H503pSoIFpLUqPdNga9CljjDUDkp7G5Lyd3bxpXUP-hvmH8RSNbXofzu2Chm)\n[7] [cobalt.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHa7nsZ_Ajw3-2wbPwDSLS47KRJ_ws1lTzIL6yrREoHseyk1Y1XWcfsHn4X59NbPjC_dfZEltVj197LxU92sq-_WA3ofSVds3QPCd0zD9BEhAEk1HJN-8Avv3WeGCzZv4mjmqqrccinpDPgAWUs1g==)\n[8] [cobaltintelligence.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKz9Jh_I6bfXM9J7znrAIf3k1OCvkGlcRhpUSG2JVhY_T_-mcjbgKIjkqfyVmT-hdf3aikJ7mm2OiSCplKyLa3n3W2LpAT6ssz7JiYQviaNNeEmbNFzt7aLeI2_PqtyTRmchmhd7cL7w==)\n[9] [bluelightai.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGtAqBJgsZxnU9291AGR-yNYl0bfP5CKrEICCZdsmQWElvXYIZpkqX8wx0RrTYNrJnsgJdI1WH7kIE9stPH_S_o2s1gNcxFZVkke_VRfSPQGf-wmDAWaSRUR3rS0Kyh2C6rZrkw1tReJtEz)"
