  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented all requested fixes and features:\n\n1. **Lock Screen & Notification Drawer Media Controls**:\n   - Integrated Android\'s `MediaSessionCompat` and `androidx.media.app.NotificationCompat.MediaStyle` into `AuraPlaybackService`.\n   - Wired bidirectional transport callbacks (`onPlay`, `onPause`, `onSkipToNext`, `onSkipToPrevious`, `onSeekTo`) directly to the active deck engine.\n   - Added notification action buttons with high-contrast playback icons (`Previous`, `Play`/`Pause`, `Next`, and `Stop`), set with `VISIBILITY_PUBLIC` so controls appear on the lock screen and notification shade.\n\n2. **Remove Local Songs from Library**:\n   - Added a delete action button on each song item in the Library view (`LibraryScreen.kt`).\n   - Connected deletion to `AuraDeckViewModel.deleteTrack`, which deletes the track from Room storage and safely unloads it from Deck A or Deck B if currently loaded.\n\n3. **Beat-Synced Visualizer with Automatic Pause Silence**:\n   - Implemented real-time playback state synchronization (`updatePlaybackState`) in `VisualizerEngine.kt`.\n   - When playback pauses, the visualizer decays to silence immediately instead of running endlessly.\n   - When playing, synthetic and hardware visualizer loops react dynamically to the track\'s BPM, VU levels, and position.\n\n4. **Buffering & Loading Progress Bar**:\n   - Added animated load and buffer status bars to both the Deck consoles and the URL ingestion card in `LibraryScreen`.\n   - Explicitly displays streaming status (`\"BUFFERING STREAM...\"`, percentage indicators, and indeterminate progress bars) to confirm audio stream loading.\n\n5. **Fix YouTube Playback & Auto-Play on Share**:\n   - Built `YouTubeAudioBridge` powered by an embedded client to play YouTube streams seamlessly.\n   - Updated `MainActivity.kt` and `AuraDeckViewModel.kt` so that sharing a link immediately adds the track to the library, loads it into Deck A, and starts playback automatically."
    modified_response: "I have implemented all requested fixes and features:\n\n1. **Lock Screen & Notification Drawer Media Controls**:\n   - Integrated Android\'s `MediaSessionCompat` and `androidx.media.app.NotificationCompat.MediaStyle` into `AuraPlaybackService`.\n   - Wired bidirectional transport callbacks (`onPlay`, `onPause`, `onSkipToNext`, `onSkipToPrevious`, `onSeekTo`) directly to the active deck engine.\n   - Added notification action buttons with high-contrast playback icons (`Previous`, `Play`/`Pause`, `Next`, and `Stop`), set with `VISIBILITY_PUBLIC` so controls appear on the lock screen and notification shade.\n\n2. **Remove Local Songs from Library**:\n   - Added a delete action button on each song item in the Library view (`LibraryScreen.kt`).\n   - Connected deletion to `AuraDeckViewModel.deleteTrack`, which deletes the track from Room storage and safely unloads it from Deck A or Deck B if currently loaded.\n\n3. **Beat-Synced Visualizer with Automatic Pause Silence**:\n   - Implemented real-time playback state synchronization (`updatePlaybackState`) in `VisualizerEngine.kt`.\n   - When playback pauses, the visualizer decays to silence immediately instead of running endlessly.\n   - When playing, synthetic and hardware visualizer loops react dynamically to the track\'s BPM, VU levels, and position.\n\n4. **Buffering & Loading Progress Bar**:\n   - Added animated load and buffer status bars to both the Deck consoles and the URL ingestion card in `LibraryScreen`.\n   - Explicitly displays streaming status (`\"BUFFERING STREAM...\"`, percentage indicators, and indeterminate progress bars) to confirm audio stream loading.\n\n5. **Fix YouTube Playback & Auto-Play on Share**:\n   - Built `YouTubeAudioBridge` powered by an embedded client to play YouTube streams seamlessly.\n   - Updated `MainActivity.kt` and `AuraDeckViewModel.kt` so that sharing a link immediately adds the track to the library, loads it into Deck A, and starts playback automatically."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
