  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Exit Functionality**\n\nI\'ve got a much clearer picture now. I\'m focusing on incorporating an exit button in the `TopAppBar` within `MainActivity.kt`. My idea is a clean, visually distinct icon button\342\200\224either a standard \"EXIT\" label and `Icons.Default.PowerSettingsNew` or, perhaps, a distinctive red/slate style with a tooltip and testTag. I\'m leaning toward the latter for clarity.\n\n\n**Implementing Exit Confirmation**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the exit confirmation dialog. I\'m building an `AlertDialog` within the `TopAppBar` click handler. It presents the user with a confirmation, detailing exactly what exiting the app entails: stopping audio, terminating services, and exiting completely. The design will feature an explicit \"EXIT APP\" button in red, contrasting with a \"CANCEL\" option. I plan to use a custom `exitApp` function and confirm dialog state management.\n\n\n**Analyzing Audio Bridge Integration**\n\nI\'m now examining the integration of hidden WebViews for persistent YouTube audio rendering. I\'m focusing on how the `AndroidView` and `ViewRootImpl` contribute to providing active window tokens, enabling the Chromium WebAudio engine to run with full audio session permissions. This setup allows immediate audio output to various devices. I\'m taking a close look at how the `YouTubeAudioBridge.kt` file handles this.\n\n\n**Refining YouTube Bridge**\n\nMy focus is now on meticulously refining the `YouTubeAudioBridge.kt` file. I\'m fine-tuning the `getView` function to return a functional `WebView`. I\'m configuring the `WebSettings` for optimal audio playback, enabling JavaScript, media playback, DOM storage, database, and file access, while setting a specific user agent. I\'m also ensuring the WebView resumes and resumes timers. Critically, I\'m correcting the `HTML_TEMPLATE`, particularly the YouTube iframe player parameters and JavaScript callbacks, ensuring correct unmute, volume, and playback control within the template.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 942943500
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
